; The one variable: a large bundled-font glyph's curved edge, filled on one Label and ringed alone
; on the other. FreeType draws each curve as chords up to 1/16 px inside it (`ftgrays.c`), so an
; edge drawn on the true curve sits a fraction of a pixel off Godot's. The ring Label has a clear
; fill, so its ring is the only ink.

